.TH garuda-toolbox-tweaks 1  "garuda-toolbox 6.3.0" 
.SH NAME
garuda\-toolbox\-tweaks \- Choose the DNS servers, the Wi\-Fi backend, hblock and garuda\-update\*(Aqs options, as the System Tweaks page does
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgaruda\-toolbox tweaks\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-search\fR \fITEXT\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR \fIWHEN\fR] [\fB\-\-width\fR \fICOLUMNS\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Choose the DNS servers, the Wi\-Fi backend, hblock and garuda\-update\*(Aqs options, as the System Tweaks page does
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print JSON instead of text, for scripts
.TP
\fB\-\-search\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Only the rows whose name contains this text, in any case
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print the programs\*(Aq own words under an error
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR
Print long text directly instead of through `$PAGER`
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Colour the output: auto, always or never
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-width\fR \fI<COLUMNS>\fR
Cut long cells to this many columns
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Leave out the spinner and the hints
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-tweaks\-list(1)
List the DNS servers, the Wi\-Fi backend, hblock and the options of garuda\-update, each as it is now
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-tweaks\-dns(1)
Choose the DNS servers NetworkManager uses
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-tweaks\-wifi\-backend(1)
Choose the program NetworkManager runs Wi\-Fi with
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-tweaks\-hblock(1)
Block ads and trackers system\-wide with hblock
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-tweaks\-update\-flag(1)
Switch an option of garuda\-update
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  garuda\-toolbox tweaks
  garuda\-toolbox tweaks dns cloudflare
.SH "SEE ALSO"
garuda\-toolbox(1)
